## posts/first-steps/index.html
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>First steps - Ink and paper</title>
<meta name="description" content="A fountain pen needs ink, patience and luck practice. The flow rate is roughly q = k \cdot w for a nib of width w.">
<link rel="canonical" href="https://ink.example/posts/first-steps">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/code.css">
<link rel="alternate" type="application/atom+xml" title="Ink and paper" href="/feed.xml">
<link rel="alternate" type="application/rss+xml" title="Ink and paper" href="/rss.xml">
<meta name="og:title" content="First steps">
<meta name="og:type" content="article">
<meta name="og:site_name" content="Ink and paper">
<meta name="og:url" content="https://ink.example/posts/first-steps">
<meta name="og:description" content="A fountain pen needs ink, patience and luck practice. The flow rate is roughly q = k \cdot w for a nib of width w.">
</head>
<body>
<div class="quiet-page">
<header class="quiet-head">
<a class="quiet-site" href="/">Ink and paper</a>
<nav aria-label="Site">
<ul>
<li>
<a href="/about">About</a>
</li>
</ul>
</nav>
</header>
<main>
<article>
<div class="quiet-meta">
<time datetime="2024-03-01">2024-03-01</time>
<ul class="quiet-tags" aria-label="Tags">
<li>#ink</li>
<li>#pens</li>
</ul>
</div>
<h1 id="first-steps">First steps<a class="quiet-anchor" href="#first-steps" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a>
</h1>
<p>A fountain pen needs <strong>ink</strong>, <em>patience</em> and <s>luck</s> practice.<sup>
<a id="ref:flow" href="#fn:flow">1</a>
</sup> The flow rate is roughly
<math>
<mi>q</mi>
<mo>=</mo>
<mi>k</mi>
<mo lspace="0.2222em" rspace="0.2222em">⋅</mo>
<mi>w</mi>
</math> for a nib of width <math>
<mi>w</mi>
</math>.</p>
<div class="quiet-math">
<math display="block">
<msubsup>
<mo lspace="0">∫</mo>
<mn>0</mn>
<mn>1</mn>
</msubsup>
<msup>
<mi>x</mi>
<mn>2</mn>
</msup>
<mspace width="0.16666667em"/>
<mi>d</mi>
<mi>x</mi>
<mo>=</mo>
<mfrac>
<mn>1</mn>
<mn>3</mn>
</mfrac>
</math>
</div>
<p>
<img src="/posts/nib.svg" alt="the nib">
</p>
<h2 id="what-to-buy">What to buy<a class="quiet-anchor" href="#what-to-buy" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a>
</h2>
<ul>
<li class="quiet-task">
<input type="checkbox" disabled checked>a converter</li>
<li class="quiet-task">
<input type="checkbox" disabled>a bottle of ink</li>
</ul>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="quiet-left">Ink</th>
<th class="quiet-right">Dries</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="quiet-left">iron gall</td>
<td class="quiet-right">slow</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="quiet-left">dye</td>
<td class="quiet-right">fast</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<aside class="quiet-callout quiet-tip">
<p class="quiet-label">Tip</p>
<p>Flush the pen every month.</p>
</aside>
<pre class="giallo hl-l-code hl-d-code" >
<code data-lang="rust">
<span class="giallo-l">
<span class="hl-l-8 hl-d-10">fn</span>
<span class="hl-l-6 hl-d-7"> main</span>
<span>(</span>
<span>)</span>
<span> {</span>
</span>
<span class="giallo-l">
<span class="hl-l-6 hl-d-7">    println!</span>
<span>(</span>
<span class="hl-l-2 hl-d-6">&quot;</span>
<span class="hl-l-2 hl-d-6">fill the pen</span>
<span class="hl-l-2 hl-d-6">&quot;</span>
<span>)</span>
<span>;</span>
</span>
<span class="giallo-l">
<span>}</span>
</span>
</code>
</pre>
<section class="quiet-notes" aria-label="Footnotes">
<ol>
<li id="fn:flow">
<p>Too much flow and the line feathers.</p>
<a class="quiet-back" href="#ref:flow" aria-label="Back to the text">↩</a>
</li>
</ol>
</section>
</article>
</main>
<footer class="quiet-foot">
<p>Ink and paper</p>
</footer>
</div>
</body>
</html>
